                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0239f6ab-432a-3e41-8f4a-23be3a39fa94",
                        "entry_id": "a20b625b-387e-3ab4-b5c9-863d6a7e7316",
                        "glosses": [
                            "переработанный для исполнения в театре, на сцене (о литературном произведении)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f77e3f04-4f83-4473-a7ae-6fdc5133646f",
                                "sense_id": "0239f6ab-432a-3e41-8f4a-23be3a39fa94",
                                "text": "Но существует театрализованный «эсэм», шоу ― его показывают на сцене, для зрителей ― с музыкой, соответствующим освещением, постановкой и всем таким…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8685aea-1c95-46d5-b851-77b2125afc7f",
                                "sense_id": "0239f6ab-432a-3e41-8f4a-23be3a39fa94",
                                "text": "Сценарий театрализованной постановки по роману М. А. Булгакова \"Мастер и Маргарита\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c65eb3d1-f072-35e8-8025-b24df30c8e9f",
                        "entry_id": "a20b625b-387e-3ab4-b5c9-863d6a7e7316",
                        "glosses": [
                            "содержащий элементы драматического действия"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e12f8b19-b7fa-4f5e-8ad5-469e8c49282a",
                                "sense_id": "c65eb3d1-f072-35e8-8025-b24df30c8e9f",
                                "text": "На сцене разыгрывался театрализованный концерт по истории Комсомола."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90108cb7-5cbb-4447-b6a2-52318818275e",
                                "sense_id": "c65eb3d1-f072-35e8-8025-b24df30c8e9f",
                                "text": "В воскресенье в «Газовике» состоялся театрализованный концерт юных дарований школ искусств области «Брависсимо»."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c9ced513-9e2e-4e22-980f-2f234d4b3beb",
                        "source_entry_id": "a20b625b-387e-3ab4-b5c9-863d6a7e7316",
                        "target_lang_word": "theatrical",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "theatrical",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "48d0c485-506b-3e01-9edc-6791229cd084",
                                        "entry_id": "a80ace66-9b2d-3a29-995d-dc883b63838f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to the theatre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a430b652-cc12-4209-a1d5-1d8fb3a1f1b9",
                                                "sense_id": "48d0c485-506b-3e01-9edc-6791229cd084",
                                                "text": "12 July 2012, Sam Adams, AV Club Ice Age: Continental Drift\nThe matter of whether the world needs a fourth Ice Age movie pales beside the question of why there were three before it, but Continental Drift feels less like an extension of a theatrical franchise than an episode of a middling TV cartoon, lolling around on territory that’s already been settled."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d2ce463-ae52-3609-aec4-63e9682fee59",
                                        "entry_id": "a80ace66-9b2d-3a29-995d-dc883b63838f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fake and exaggerated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bca3855f-a5f7-42d8-ad9c-67dbfa7b3f3e",
                                                "sense_id": "0d2ce463-ae52-3609-aec4-63e9682fee59",
                                                "text": "The ceremony and its scene were characterised by that high sense of the theatrical which has marked the activities of the Third Reich."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "theatrical",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e5e6775-32eb-3fca-8395-60d4977b0410",
                                        "entry_id": "85223b00-4e11-3b54-ba86-f6f3a976b577",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A stage performance, especially one by amateurs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f7bab56-17ce-37a7-8af6-04242a1f5495",
                                        "entry_id": "85223b00-4e11-3b54-ba86-f6f3a976b577",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A commercially produced film to be shown in movie theaters."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e3d3be1-ac73-49dd-903b-3655c774c888",
                                                "sense_id": "5f7bab56-17ce-37a7-8af6-04242a1f5495",
                                                "text": "Release schedules were stepped up so that virtually all of the summer theatricals are coming to video before year's end."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "149e304c-c8fc-35d1-8510-00ad707ff995",
                                        "entry_id": "85223b00-4e11-3b54-ba86-f6f3a976b577",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who works in theatre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1927b07a-888e-4704-ad2c-ea35b46b349b",
                                                "sense_id": "149e304c-c8fc-35d1-8510-00ad707ff995",
                                                "text": "Both of her parents were theatricals — that is, the father played the violin and the mother attempted to dance but later she dropped the pretence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
